OL,3,CWarning issued to public after grass
OL,4,Cfire breaks out near family farm estate
OL,6,FFirefighters have shared a photo of a
OL,7,Fgrass fire that broke out over the
OL,8,Fweekend in Kent, as a warning to
OL,9,Fpeople to help reduce the risks.
OL,11,FThe fire broke out in Church Field in
OL,12,FTudeley near Tonbridge on Saturday.
OL,14,FA Kent Fire and Rescue spokesperson
OL,15,Fsaid: "Thankfully, no-one was hurt and
OL,16,Four firefighters worked hard to stop
OL,17,Fthe flames from spreading further.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
