PN,38903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785242914
OL,3,CWarning issued to public after grass
OL,4,Cfire breaks out near family farm estate
OL,6,FThe Hadlow Estate thanked the fire
OL,7,Fservice for their "prompt response" to
OL,8,Fthe fire.
OL,10,FA spokesperson said: "We are relieved
OL,11,Fto say no-one was hurt and the fire
OL,12,Fdid not spread to the livery at Bank
OL,13,FFarm Stables.
OL,15,F"Investigations are continuing into
OL,16,Fthe cause of the fire, which started
OL,17,Fnear the pond in Church Field.
OL,19,F"If you have any information about the
OL,20,Fincident we would be grateful if you
OL,21,Fcould contact us."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/3
